note: Math words: half of, twice, percent of, the remainder of, is infinite, ", rounded down".
let price be 80.
say half of price, twice price, 20 percent of price.
say twice price plus 1, half of price minus 1.
say 12.5 percent of 200, half of -3.
let rate be 15.
say rate percent of price.
say the remainder of 17 divided by 5, the remainder of 18 divided by 3.
say 17 divided by 5, rounded down.
say 17 divided by 5, rounded up.
let huge be 10 to the power of 400.
say huge is infinite, price is infinite, price isn't infinite, huge is not infinite.
if -huge is infinite, say "Minus infinity is infinite too.".
